# metadata/tv.rules

See core.rules for documentation standards.

## Fields for TV Shows
- id, title, original_title
- summary, tagline, genres, keywords
- first_air_date, last_air_date
- seasons_count, episodes_count
- status, runtime_per_episode
- networks, production_companies
- creators, showrunners, producers
- cast, guest_stars
- ratings (IMDb, TMDb, Plex), user_rating
- content_rating, audio/subtitle languages
- external_ids, file_path, total_file_size
